@startuml
title Borehole Management System - V-Model

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Requirements Analysis" as A
rectangle "System Design" as B
rectangle "Architecture Design" as C
rectangle "Detailed Design" as D
rectangle "Implementation" as E

rectangle "Acceptance Testing" as F
rectangle "System Testing" as G
rectangle "Integration Testing" as H
rectangle "Unit Testing" as I

A -down-> B
B -down-> C
C -down-> D
D -down-> E

E -up-> I
I -up-> H
H -up-> G
G -up-> F

A .. F : Acceptance criteria
B .. G : System requirements
C .. H : Component interfaces
D .. I : Module specifications

@enduml
